# SHA-256 of luna's release archives for the version pinned in luna.version.
# scripts/install-luna.sh refuses an archive whose sum is not here. After a
# pin bump, take the four sums from GitHub, which computes them when luna
# uploads each file (another channel than the download itself):
#   V=$(cat testing/luna.version)
#   gh api repos/k0b3n4irb/luna/releases/tags/$V --jq '.assets[] | "\(.digest|sub("sha256:";""))  \(.name)"'
# and check one archive you downloaded against its line (sha256sum).
97242c2ed72bd7b219429307d294f1bd1b672bdca372335d959d2d01ff868f24  luna_v1.44.0_darwin_arm64.zip
40ba1179be57de4688c11e58e28cc82358edd560da1e8644fd3a71d3189987e5  luna_v1.44.0_linux_arm64.zip
11a084bcbc1f191eb0362cd0d9da8d215c27ff0861303966839957129f32f1fb  luna_v1.44.0_linux_x86_64.zip
ab6f1216d99be6fca4666fb9cb343438f9d29e7ab641d36a65f045c846c412bc  luna_v1.44.0_windows_x86_64.zip
